1. Scope

"Model Assets" means the FastGripper simulation files distributed under
assets/fastgripper/ or assets/fastgripper_v1_1/, including meshes, MJCF/XML, parameter data and accompanying
asset documentation. "Published Interfaces" means attachment information that
Licensor expressly publishes for connecting compatible accessories to a
FastGripper. Simulation dimensions alone are not a manufacturing specification.
"Compatible Accessories" means separately designed fingertips, pads, mounts,
adapters and attachments intended for use with a lawfully obtained FastGripper.
It does not include a reproduction of the gripper's actuator, transmission,
linkage, housing or core gripping mechanism.

